   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!-- add facs="" once an image is available -->
            <ab xml:id="MP0600_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>dʾṭynwndʾṭ pṭyhwyh
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>Y QDM ẔNH p(ʾ)ṭglʾḇ
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>npšṭˈ YKʿYMWNyṭ sṭwlʾn
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>$ hcpl hwṭʾykˈ lʾd
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>ʾL sycˈ Y bwnʾp̄ʾṭˈ Y
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>dyn ʾswlyk YḤBWNṭ′ bnd
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>Y ẔNH ʾḇyȳṭkʾl PWN
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>mwdl Y ʾwsṭndʾl
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>ḤṬYMWNṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0600_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Dādē󠌄nwindād padē󠌄xīh
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>ī abar 󠌄ēn pādīrāy
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>nibišt est󠌄ēd stōrān
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>20 azabar xwadāyīg rāy
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>ō sē󠌄ǰ ī *bunābād ī
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>d󠌄ēn asūrīg dād band
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>ī 󠌄ēn āyādgār pad
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>muhr ī ōstāndār
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0600_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1-9" xml:id="trans-p1-l1-9"/>Dād󠌄ēnwindād provided 20 mounts for the crops on which this receipt has been written for the sake of the above (mentioned) Sir (= Dād󠌄ēnwindād) to meet the trouble of the bun centre (depository of the bun) of the Nestorians (lit. Syrian religion). He sealed the tie of this reminder with the seal of the Ōstāndār.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>